# Root-level extracted/translated JSONL files are local working data. Synthetic
# fixtures under tests/ remain trackable when they are deliberately added.
/*.jsonl

# WOLF/RPG Maker game installations and official text-export working trees.
**/Data_AutoTXT/
**/Data_AutoTXT_*/
**/BasicData/
**/MapData/
**/Data/*.dat
**/Data/*.mps
*.wolf
*.wolfx
[Gg]ame.exe
