[Ee]ditor.exe
[Cc]onfig.exe

# Deliberately authored, minimal synthetic fixtures may be versioned here.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic/
!tests/fixtures/synthetic/**

# Local credentials and environment overrides. A documented example may be
# committed explicitly as .env.example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
